#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-v6x-overview.rst:5
#: c4436fd3cd60401ca56bd569c1288888
msgid "ARKV6X Flight Controller Overview"
msgstr "ARKV6X 飞控概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-v6x-overview.rst:11
#: 7b71591c326344a3bab885d273ed5488
msgid ""
"The USA-built ARKV6X flight controller is based on the `FMUV6X and Pixhawk "
"Autopilot Bus open source standards <https://github.com/pixhawk/Pixhawk-"
"Standards>`__. With triple synced IMUs, data averaging, voting, and "
"filtering is possible. The Pixhawk Autopilot Bus (PAB) form factor enables "
"the ARKV6X to be used on any PAB-compatible carrier board, such as the `ARK "
"Pixhawk Autopilot Bus Carrier <https://arkelectron.com/product/ark-pixhawk-"
"autopilot-bus-carrier/>`__."
msgstr ""
"美国制造的 ARKV6X 飞控基于 `FMUV6X 和 Pixhawk 飞控总线开源标准 "
"<https://github.com/pixhawk/Pixhawk-Standards>`__。凭借三重同步 "
"IMU，可实现数据平均、投票和滤波。Pixhawk 飞控总线（PAB）外形规格使 ARKV6X 可用于任何兼容 PAB 的载板，例如 `ARK "
"Pixhawk 飞控总线载板 <https://arkelectron.com/product/ark-pixhawk-autopilot-bus-"
"carrier/>`__。"

